0000106C                           110  ; RANDOM_0_99 random number generator, returns current time since midnight, but then trims it down to a number 0 - 99
0000106C                           111  ; returns a number in range 0 - 99 into D0, so 100 possible numbers, making it easier to set percentages. 0 - 9 is a 10 % chance as it is first 10 possible numbers etc.
