000019F5                           609  ; Lore message to come after title card
000019F5= 0D 0A                    610  MSG_GAME_START: DC.B $0D,$0A
000019F7= 31 35 20 79 65 61 ...    611                  DC.B '15 years ago, the planet reached its limit.' 
00001A22= 59 65 61 72 73 20 ...    612                  DC.B 'Years of extraction of resources from the planets crust have finally caught up. '
00001A72= 0D 0A                    613                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001A74= 54 68 65 20 67 72 ...    614                  DC.B 'The gravity started to wane, and now it isnt strong enough to keep you held down.'
00001AC5= 0D 0A                    615                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001AC7= 4D 6F 73 74 20 70 ...    616                  DC.B 'Most people have floated away into the sky above, never to return.'
00001B09= 0D 0A                    617                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001B0B= 59 6F 75 2C 20 61 ...    618                  DC.B 'You, and those others remaining, have survived by fastening heavy scrap into'
00001B57= 0D 0A                    619                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001B59= 61 72 6D 6F 72 20 ...    620                  DC.B 'armor that can keep you weighed down enough,'
00001B85= 0D 0A                    621                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001B87= 68 6F 77 65 76 65 ...    622                  DC.B 'however resources are running out. '
00001BAA= 0D 0A                    623                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001BAC= 54 68 6F 73 65 20 ...    624                  DC.B 'Those left fight for scraps, anything they can take to hold themselves down. '
00001BF9= 0D 0A                    625                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001BFB= 54 68 65 72 65 20 ...    626                  DC.B 'There are rumors of a band of survivors, iron-clad in scrapmetal, '
00001C3D= 0D 0A                    627                  DC.B $0D,$0A 
00001C3F= 77 68 6F 20 72 6F ...    628                  DC.B 'who roam the wasteland and protect their own.'
00001C6C= 0D 0A                    629                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001C6E= 4D 61 79 62 65 20 ...    630                  DC.B 'Maybe if you can fashion a suit of armour like theirs, they will let you join them?'
00001CC1= 0D 0A                    631                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001CC3= 4F 72 20 6D 61 79 ...    632                  DC.B 'Or maybe, someone may come for your resources and leave you unable to keep yourself grounded.'
00001D20= 0D 0A                    633                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001D22= 0D 0A                    634                  DC.B $0D,$0A
00001D24= 0D 0A 00                 635                  DC.B $0D,$0A, 0
