0000239F= 0D 0A                    714                 DC.B $0D,$0A
000023A1= 59 6F 75 20 68 61 ...    715                 DC.B 'You have done it, you have gathered enough scrap to fasten a '
000023DE= 0D 0A                    716                 DC.B $0D,$0A
000023E0= 73 75 69 74 20 68 ...    717                 DC.B 'suit heavy enough to keep you on the ground.'
0000240C= 0D 0A                    718                 DC.B $0D,$0A
0000240E= 59 6F 75 20 68 61 ...    719                 DC.B 'You have heard stories in the wasteland of a group of people '
0000244B= 0D 0A                    720                 DC.B $0D,$0A
0000244D= 77 68 6F 20 77 61 ...    721                 DC.B 'who walk in iron suits, a brotherhood of sorts. '
