0000247F= 4E 6F 77 20 79 6F ...    723                 DC.B 'Now you can head out and search for them, perhaps they will take you '
000024C4= 0D 0A                    724                 DC.B $0D,$0A
000024C6= 69 6E 20 73 6F 20 ...    725                 DC.B 'in so that you may finally have safe company in this god forsaken reality.'
00002510= 0D 0A                    726                 DC.B $0D,$0A
00002512= 59 6F 75 20 73 68 ...    727                 DC.B 'You should head out tomorrow morning, take what you can and start a new life with purpose.'
