00002668= 0D 0A                    737                 DC.B $0D,$0A
0000266A= 59 6F 75 20 6D 61 ...    738                 DC.B 'You managed to gather what you could and fasten your boots to be heavy enough to weigh you down. '
000026CB= 0D 0A                    739                 DC.B $0D,$0A
000026CD= 59 6F 75 20 77 6F ...    740                 DC.B 'You wont float away into an endless void, but now there is no one left but you. '
0000271D= 0D 0A                    741                 DC.B $0D,$0A
